/F1 9.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.00 589.55 Tm (a++ fails | Use a += 1;) Tj
/F1 9.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.00 574.55 Tm (Cannot print a number | Return the result as an exit code.) Tj
/F1 9.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 72.00 559.55 Tm (let x = 1; | Specify the type: int x = 1;) Tj
