/F2 15.00 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 502.30 Tm (FAQ) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 483.80 Tm (Why doesn't my class run? class/struct/new are supported by the frontend, but not by native) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 469.30 Tm (lowering. Can I store strings? Yes. Literals, local variables, top-level const/mut string, internal) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 454.80 Tm (parameters, and returns use UTF-8 slices; a + b creates heap strings \(without deallocation\). How do I) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 440.30 Tm (debug? Use nortexc check, nortexc mir, and exit codes; there is no debugger. Is Linux supported?) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 425.80 Tm (No, Windows x64 only. Are there modules? Yes: using util; resolves util.nx or util/mod.nx \(flat) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 62.00 411.30 Tm (namespace\); see the implemented specification.) Tj
