/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 70.00 289.55 Tm (•) Tj
/F1 10.50 Tf 1 0 0 1 88.00 289.55 Tm (Error checking: check for 0 before division \(otherwise it traps rather than reporting an error\).) Tj
